WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.958 --> 00:00:02.958
[Kot-nim] Uncle Tae-ho,
you wanna know something?

00:00:03.416 --> 00:00:06.791
There's no up or down in space.

00:00:06.833 --> 00:00:10.625
Nothing out here is better
or worse than anything else.

00:00:14.375 --> 00:00:15.500
Smile!

00:00:16.666 --> 00:00:20.041
That's because everything out here
has its special place.

00:00:20.041 --> 00:00:21.583
Hey, Kot-nim, are you doing okay?

00:00:21.833 --> 00:00:23.583
Humans are not harmful.

00:00:23.875 --> 00:00:25.625
[Bubs] Hey, everyone. Calm down, okay?
You need to stay calm! Calm down, please.

00:00:26.916 --> 00:00:28.208
[Tae-ho] This is the only way.

00:00:28.208 --> 00:00:30.666
Affirmed.
Please, don't take Sara away from us.

00:00:30.666 --> 00:00:31.750
Take care, Kot-nim, dear.

00:00:32.125 --> 00:00:32.791
Sara.

00:00:32.833 --> 00:00:33.666
Take care, Kot-nim, dear.

00:00:34.083 --> 00:00:35.208
We beg you.

00:00:39.791 --> 00:00:40.958
Life-form detected.

00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:42.750
You found her in the cabin?

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:45.250
This is a mammal. A human.

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:46.583
Mama!

00:00:46.666 --> 00:00:48.166
Papa!

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.208
[Tae-ho] A missing child. Great.

00:00:50.333 --> 00:00:52.083
I'm surprised that she survived.

00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:55.208
Harmful organic substance detected!

00:00:55.291 --> 00:00:56.541
Sara.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:58.833
Sara.

00:00:59.416 --> 00:01:00.208
What was your name again?

00:01:00.416 --> 00:01:01.416
Kot-nim is my name.

00:01:01.416 --> 00:01:02.250
Kot-nim. That's pretty.

00:01:02.375 --> 00:01:04.375
If we find her parents,
think they'd pay us?

00:01:04.416 --> 00:01:05.500
I don't have a home.

00:01:05.833 --> 00:01:07.125
Humans are harmful.

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:10.916
Not reporting is considered an anomaly.
Get reprogrammed.

00:01:10.958 --> 00:01:14.000
[reporter 2] Meanwhile, UTS authorities
continue to search for Dorothy.

00:01:14.208 --> 00:01:16.541
The innocent face masks a deadly weapon.

00:01:16.625 --> 00:01:19.125
The robot is highly lethal.
Extremely dangerous.

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:22.041
Report. Do it later.

00:01:22.458 --> 00:01:24.750
-Sara!
-Will get detected.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:25.833
What's up with that kid?

00:01:25.916 --> 00:01:27.458
That kid is a fucking bomb.

00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:31.083
No! No! Stay back! No, no!

00:01:32.833 --> 00:01:33.833
Security guard!

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:35.416
Security guard will detect.
Will surely detect.

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:39.583
Report or be reprogrammed.
Say we just found it now.

00:01:39.583 --> 00:01:41.291
[Bubs] The bomb won't go off
if she gets upset?

00:01:41.416 --> 00:01:42.916
[Tae-ho] Shut up and call up the cops.

00:01:42.958 --> 00:01:44.958
Nine, zero, zero.

00:01:45.291 --> 00:01:48.583
We possess human. If discovered...

00:01:48.666 --> 00:01:49.500
What now?

00:01:49.583 --> 00:01:50.666
Leave it?

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:53.291
[Park] Be quiet and stay still.

00:01:53.375 --> 00:01:56.166
-Hey, are you listening to me?
-But I'm already still.

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:58.416
-That's--
-Look at these other ones I drew.

00:01:59.708 --> 00:02:02.500
But Sara cannot recharge alone.

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:03.583
Papa!

00:02:03.833 --> 00:02:04.708
Mama!

00:02:08.041 --> 00:02:09.250
Affirmative.

00:02:09.375 --> 00:02:11.083
Do we think Kot-nim
is something to be afraid of?

00:02:11.166 --> 00:02:13.125
-Better watch out! [roars]
-[giggles]

00:02:18.250 --> 00:02:20.208
Hey, I told you to wait on the ship!

00:02:20.375 --> 00:02:21.750
-Two? That's two dollars.
-Two tomatoes for you.

00:02:22.291 --> 00:02:24.416
Yay, we're gonna be a huge success!

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:27.541
Human! My belief is proven!

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:30.333
Sara! I have told you many times
to stop doing that.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:33.916
It's all right. PJ will always catch me.

00:02:34.166 --> 00:02:35.708
Hey, Kang Kot-nim, how come
you haven't drawn me yet?

00:02:35.708 --> 00:02:38.041
You were the first person
I drew, Uncle Tae-ho.

00:02:38.125 --> 00:02:40.125
I didn't show you
because I was scared of you.

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:43.791
I don't know how.

00:02:43.875 --> 00:02:45.791
-Don't worry about it.
-Whoa!

00:03:01.833 --> 00:03:02.791
What is this place?

00:03:02.791 --> 00:03:05.166
Today, I present to you

00:03:05.166 --> 00:03:06.375
the home,

00:03:06.416 --> 00:03:09.333
the answer to our quest

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:14.041
-What was that place?
-Enough of that.

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:15.208
-Why?
-It's dangerous.

00:03:15.208 --> 00:03:20.291
Many of the robots that live outside
believe humans are evil.

00:03:20.375 --> 00:03:22.208
[Sullivan] "Giant mass
of space junk falls to Earth!"

00:03:22.291 --> 00:03:24.708
"Earth destroyed by catastrophic impact!"

00:03:25.083 --> 00:03:26.416
Who cares if a billion lives are lost?

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:29.833
Not again! I'm the only one
who's not allowed to do anything!

00:03:29.916 --> 00:03:30.750
Sara!

00:03:30.833 --> 00:03:33.416
Why am I the only human?

00:03:33.708 --> 00:03:34.625
[Park] Kot-nim!

00:03:34.708 --> 00:03:36.416
[Kot-nim, muffled] Uncle Tiger!

00:03:38.416 --> 00:03:40.625
[Karum] Sullivan is not
a savior of humanity.

00:03:40.666 --> 00:03:42.958
He wants to destroy everything on Earth!

00:03:43.458 --> 00:03:44.416
Why do you hate humans so much?

00:03:44.416 --> 00:03:46.625
Why do you hate humans so much?

00:03:46.625 --> 00:03:50.958
Because they get in the way
of creating a perfect world.

00:03:51.125 --> 00:03:51.916
Where is Dorothy?

00:03:52.791 --> 00:03:53.833
Give her to me!

00:03:53.833 --> 00:03:56.583
Sara may break a few things,

00:03:56.708 --> 00:03:59.750
but humans have the power of creation.

00:04:01.791 --> 00:04:04.958
[reporter 5]&nbsp;More than three billion
people are expected to die on Earth

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:07.833
All defying robots are to be reprogrammed.

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:09.583
I grant you that authority.

00:04:12.166 --> 00:04:13.625
Mom!

00:04:13.875 --> 00:04:15.916
-Dad!
-Dad!

00:04:18.458 --> 00:04:19.666
-Sara!
-Sara!

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:25.458
I'm glad you're safe.

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:28.458
[Kot-nim] We're one big family now.

00:04:28.625 --> 00:04:29.541
[Tae-ho] You've been slacking.

00:04:29.625 --> 00:04:31.500
Keep it up, and I'll send you
to boarding school.

00:04:31.583 --> 00:04:33.291
-Good idea.
-Stop. Don't be ridiculous.

00:04:33.791 --> 00:04:36.333
It feels like only yesterday
when she was little.

00:04:36.333 --> 00:04:41.666
She couldn't even harvest her own food.
Now look what she can make.

00:04:41.916 --> 00:04:43.625
You guys are the best team I ever had.

00:04:43.791 --> 00:04:44.750
And my best friends.

00:04:44.916 --> 00:04:46.541
Dad, Mom.

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:49.666
[Bubs sighs]
You guys know I love you, right?

00:04:49.791 --> 00:04:53.041
You're the robots that raised me,
after all.

00:04:55.541 --> 00:04:57.333
You little fart machine.

00:04:57.541 --> 00:04:59.916
Harmful organic substance detected.
Eliminate.

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:03.666
Harmful organic substance detected!

